 "gaps": [
  {
   "id": "G-A43-1",
   "kind": "measurement (the headline gap)",
   "text": "N5 (W1) and N6 (W2) are EXACT and were applied at the Level-0 window scale, and they kill NOTHING: the certified m_low over a wall-mask centre box (x full tilt t in [0,1]) is 0.000000 for all 9 admissible masks, against the threshold 1 + eta = 1.40295728. The windows are the whole container up to a wall strip; no atomic-measure lower bound survives that much translation freedom. The filters are sound and simply have no purchase on a purely combinatorial structure -- they need position information the census does not carry."
  },
  {
   "id": "G-A43-2",
