   "text": "N2 and N3 are EXACT but EXISTENTIAL over the 11 squares. On a loaded core of k < 11 the A38.1 / THM3 witness may be one of the 11-k rattlers, so neither is a legitimate prune below k = 11. They are reported as columns and folded in only in the k = 11 projection."
